# Line endings are deliberately NOT normalized.
#
# Consolidation preserves file contents byte-for-byte (decision D5), and 7 of the
# 124 people-kg YAML files use CRLF upstream while everything else uses LF. An
# earlier version of this file set `text eol=lf`, which would have silently
# rewritten those 7 files on the first checkout. See docs/KNOWN_ISSUES.md.
#
# To normalize later:  set `*.yml text eol=lf`, run `git add --renormalize .`,
# and commit the result as its own explicit commit.

# Binary files: never diff, never convert.
*.gpkg     binary
*.xlsx     binary
*.pkl      binary
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.zip      binary

# Large generated data: track as text but do not attempt EOL conversion.
*.geojson  -text
*.ipynb    -text
